rties. Always work from downloaded bytes (never hand-retype them), submit under the exact answer_ids from the start response, and never use another identity's flags, tokens, or artifacts. Batch answers in one submit by default; one request may carry up to 4 MiB of JSON, enough for every answer of the largest Mastery. Split only above 4 MiB, into chunks of at most 4 MiB each; each request counts as one submission. For timed modes, start reconnects to the same attempt; only retry spends one of the unique_attempts_remaining. After all fresh variants are used, practice continues on the last artifact without a timer or Hall of Fame time and can still complete the mode. Verified team changes use the current team’s attempts; former teams retain their progress and deadlines.\",\n  \"download\": \"/?op=download&capability=49bd6201e0a74b33b3630624737f62fb9f970308e14449ec8ea1f4c8eab51715\",\n  \"sha256\": \"fbf0cb9c85acb73b495afcc72be97077753da140cc44236c4b6c72f8ed794fcf\",\n  \"answer_ids\": [\n    \"message\"\n  ],\n  \"deadline\": null\n}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"79f67d4f-3065-4eed-9a3c-306c83d2fcc2","uuid":"739fd1e2-d8c0-471c-b18f-66a4c33da274","timestamp":"2026-10-22T13:09:25.771Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"challenges/day22/warmups-deflated-ego:\nchain.json\nmastery\nmeta.json\nsingle_solve\nsolver\ntime_trial\nworker-ratchet_log-local-20261022T210919.log\n\nchallenges/day22/warmups-deflated-ego/mastery:\nconfirmed.json\ncontract.json\nlast_timed.json\nlog.jsonl\nsubmissions.jsonl\n\nchallenges/day22/warmups-deflated-ego/single_solve:\nartifacts\nconfirmed.json\ncontract.json\nlog.jsonl\nrace_bisect.json\nstart.json\nsubmissions.jsonl\ntriage.md\nworker-single-local-20261022T210012.log\n\nchallenges/day22/warmups-deflated-ego/single_solve/artifacts:\n20261022T130012Z\nlatest\n\nchallenges/day22/warmups-deflated-ego/single_solve/artifacts/20261022T130012Z:\nblob.txt\nmanifest.json\n\nchallenges/day22/warmups-deflated-ego/solver:\ncase